  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed in formal contexts — corporate governance, government appointments, academic positions, and organizational leadership. Often paired with {任期|にんき} (term of office).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {再任|さいにん}される (to be reappointed)\n- {再任|さいにん}を{求|もと}める (to seek reappointment)\n- {再任|さいにん}{可|か} (eligible for reappointment)\n- {再任|さいにん}{不可|ふか} (not eligible for reappointment)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {任命|にんめい}: appointment — the first appointment to a position\n- {再選|さいせん}: reelection — specifically for elected positions",
